{
  "rationale": "The plant models robot perception and actuation, separating sensing and motion. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward for short progress, conservative turn recovery on obstacles, and full_rotate only as last resort. All obstacle events force recovery before resuming exploration. Determinism and safety are strictly maintained.",
